            "width": 672,
            "height": 112,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Self-provoking trigger flow\n\nThe top lane creates and fulfills a test order, and a minute later changes its tracking number (`fulfillmentTrackingInfoUpdate`) one minute after the start — keep the first **Wait**: it lets the webhook subscription become active. The app needs a fulfillment write scope (merchant-managed fulfillment orders). The test order is deleted after `AfterAll`."
